wg-headshot-window-hint = Link an image of your character's face. People who examine you up close see it while your face is uncovered. The link must point straight at the image file (right-click the image and copy its address), not a page or a redirecting short link. Use https and a PNG, JPG, GIF or WebP; it is shrunk to {$size}x{$size} pixels.
